# UI Development Best Practices

## Coding

ALWAYS use the relevant api client to make API calls (e.g. `userApi`)
Always prefer to reuse existing components and patterns rather than creating new ones.

### Components
There's a new project preference for shadcn/ui components. Use them whenever possible. When adding a new component, use the typescript version. The project was created as .js, so files that consume these components must be converted to .tsx.
- ALWAYS use shadcn tooltip instead of titles or popovers.